    "shared_staves": [],
    "notes": "Two parts: Violin (1 staff) and Piano (ONE part, 2 staves). 8 bars of 4/4 in D major. Grace notes take no time: slashed acciaccaturas (bar 1 beat 1 = before the very first note, bar 4 beat 1, bar 6 last eighth), unslashed appoggiatura (bar 1), unslashed grace groups of 2 x 16th (bar 1), 3 x 32nd (bar 2), 4 x 16th (bar 5) and a single unslashed grace (bar 7). Fermatas sound together in all three staves: bar 2 beat 1 (violin note, piano chords), bar 4 beat 1, bar 8 (final chord AND final quarter rest in every staff). Beamed 16th/32nd groups including 8.+32+32, 8+r16+16 (beam over a 16th rest, backward beamlet) and an 8-note 32nd run; tie b'4~b'16 (bar 7).",
    "lyrics": [],
    "measures": 8,
    "first_measure_number": 1
  },
  "truth_limitations": [
    "Grace notes are <grace/> notes without <duration> (slash=\"yes\" for acciaccaturas); the slur that LilyPond engraves for \\acciaccatura / \\appoggiatura is encoded as slur number 2.",
    "<beam> elements reproduce the engraved beam groups exactly (manual beaming); notes only - a rest inside a beam carries no <beam> element."
  ],
